Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; "Open with jucyaudio" entry in the right-click menu of any file.
; [INSTALLDIR] is a WiX/MSI property that resolves at install time to the chosen
; install directory (with a trailing backslash), so the command points at the
; installed JucyAudio.exe wherever the user put it. The keys are removed on
; uninstall. (MSIS does NOT expand $$VAR$$ here -- only its own variables are
; substituted at generation time; INSTALLDIR is a runtime property.)
; Replaces the legacy NSIS "Register Shell Extension" section.

[HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\*\shell\jucyaudio]
@="Open with jucyaudio"
"Icon"="[INSTALLDIR]JucyAudio.exe"
"Position"="Middle"

[HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\*\shell\jucyaudio\command]
@="\"[INSTALLDIR]JucyAudio.exe\" \"%1\""
